nsumer Number</div><div class='value'>{{consumerNumber}}</div></div><div class='info-item'><div class='label'>Full Name</div><div class='value'>{{fullName}}</div></div><div class='info-item'><div class='label'>Premises Type</div><div class='value'>{{premisesType}}</div></div><div class='info-item'><div class='label'>Connection Type</div><div class='value'>{{connectionType}}</div></div><div class='info-item'><div class='label'>Sanctioned Load</div><div class='value'>{{sanctionedLoadKW}} kW</div></div><div class='info-item'><div class='label'>Tariff Category</div><div class='value'>{{tariffCategoryCode}}</div></div><div class='info-item'><div class='label'>Meter Number</div><div class='value'>{{meterNumber}}</div></div></div><div class='qr-section'><img src='{{qr}}' alt='QR Code'/><div class='scan-text'>Scan to verify credential</div></div></div><div class='footer'><div class='issuer'>Issued by IES Energy Utility</div><div class='date'>This is a digitally signed verifiable credential</div></div></div></body></html>",
